{"id":57895,"date":"2026-08-08T14:44:04","date_gmt":"2026-08-08T13:44:04","guid":{"rendered":""},"modified":"2026-10-27T15:57:55","modified_gmt":"2026-10-27T14:57:55","slug":"maratona-de-copenhaga","status":"publish","type":"ajde_events","link":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/eventos\/maratona-de-copenhaga\/","title":{"rendered":"Maratona de Copenhaga 2027"},"content":{"rendered":"<style>.event_description, .eventcard, .evo_eventcard, .pr-page-wrapper { height: auto !important; max-height: none !important; overflow: visible !important; }<\/style><!-- CARD 1: DESCRI\u00c7\u00c3O GERAL --><div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\"><h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 16px;\">Sobre <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">Maratona de Copenhaga 2027<\/span><\/h2><p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">A <strong>Maratona de Copenhaga 2027<\/strong> (<strong>Copenhagen Marathon<\/strong>) realiza-se no domingo, <strong>9 de maio de 2027<\/strong>, com tiro de partida \u00e0s <strong>09:30<\/strong> em <strong>Copenhaga, Dinamarca<\/strong>. Integrada no prestigiado circuito internacional <strong>European Marathon Classics<\/strong> e homologada pela <strong>World Athletics<\/strong>, a prova destaca-se pelo seu tra\u00e7ado metropolitano de <strong>42,195 km<\/strong> integralmente plano e veloz, atravessando o centro hist\u00f3rico (Indre By), \u00d8sterbro, Christianshavn, Vesterbro, N\u00f8rrebro e Frederiksberg.<\/p><p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">A partida e a meta (Runners Area, aberta a partir das 07:30, junto \u00e0s esta\u00e7\u00f5es de Metro Trianglen, Vibenshus Runddel e Poul Henningsens Plads) d\u00e3o in\u00edcio a um percurso monumental que passa pelos Lagos de Copenhaga, Pal\u00e1cio de Amalienborg, Igreja de M\u00e1rmore (Frederiks Kirke), Ponte Dronning Louises, Langebro e frente ribeirinha de Islands Brygge. Ao longo dos 42,195 km existem <strong>12 zonas de abastecimento e energia<\/strong> (aos 3,8 km, 8,1 km, 12,3 km, 16 km, 19,8 km, 21,1 km, 24,3 km, 27,8 km, 32,7 km, 35,3 km, 35,7 km e 38,3 km) com \u00e1gua, bebida isot\u00f3nica High5, g\u00e9is energ\u00e9ticos, fruta e Power Zones.<\/p><p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 0;\">Organizada pela associa\u00e7\u00e3o <strong>Sparta Atletik &amp; L\u00f8b<\/strong>, a edi\u00e7\u00e3o de 2027 registou uma procura hist\u00f3rica superior a 80 000 candidatos de mais de 160 nacionalidades para 35 000 dorsais, atribu\u00eddos pela primeira vez atrav\u00e9s de sorteio oficial (lotaria), complementado por inscri\u00e7\u00f5es via operadores tur\u00edsticos oficiais e programas solid\u00e1rios (Charity). Todos os participantes disp\u00f5em de um tempo limite l\u00edquido de 6h00, t-shirt t\u00e9cnica oficial Nike, dorsal personalizado e medalha exclusiva de finalista.<\/p><\/div><!-- CARD 2: FICHA T\u00c9CNICA \/ SNAPSHOT --><div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.06); border: 1px solid rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.25); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\"><h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u26a1 Ficha <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">T\u00e9cnica \/ Snapshot<\/span><\/h2><ul class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-grid\" style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(240px, 1fr)); gap: 16px; width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box; list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 0;\"><li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Data & Hor\u00e1rio<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">9 de Maio de 2027 \u00e0s 09:30<\/span><\/li><li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Local, Concelho & Distrito<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">Copenhaga, Dinamarca<\/span><\/li><li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Dist\u00e2ncias<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">42,195 km<\/span><\/li><li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Entidade Organizadora<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">Sparta Atletik & L\u00f8b<\/span><\/li><li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Tempo Limite (Cut-off)<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">6h00 (tempo l\u00edquido; encerramento da meta \u00e0s 16:00)<\/span><\/li><li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.08); border: 1px solid rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.3); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #C4B5FD; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Regulamento Oficial<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\"><a href=\"https:\/\/copenhagenmarathon.dk\/en\/terms-and-conditions\/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" style=\"color: #38BDF8; text-decoration: none; display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 6px;\">\n                    \ud83d\udcc4 Consultar Regulamento Oficial &rarr;\n                <\/a><\/span><\/li><div style=\"grid-column: 1 \/ -1; margin-top: 8px;\"><strong style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px; display: block; margin-bottom: 10px;\">\ud83c\udfc3 Programa de Provas & Sub-eventos<\/strong><div style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(260px, 1fr)); gap: 12px;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; gap: 12px; flex-wrap: wrap;\"><div><span style=\"color: #C4B5FD; font-size: 11px; text-transform: uppercase; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.5px; display: block;\">Maratona<\/span><strong style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px;\">Maratona de Copenhaga 42,195 km<\/strong><span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 13px; display: block; margin-top: 2px;\">\ud83d\udcc5 9 de Maio de 2027 \u2022 \u23f0 Partida: 09:30<\/span><\/div><div style=\"text-align: right; background: rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.08); padding: 6px 12px; border-radius: 10px; border: 1px solid rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.2);\"><div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">Lotaria Oficial:<\/strong> 136,00 \u20ac (995 DKK + 20 DKK taxa)<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (Vagas Charity \/ Tour Operators dispon\u00edveis)<\/span><\/div><\/div><\/div><\/div><\/div><\/ul><\/div><!-- CARD 3: PERGUNTAS FREQUENTES (FAQS) --><div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\"><h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u2753 Perguntas <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">Frequentes (FAQ)<\/span><\/h2><details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\"><summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quando e a que horas se realiza a Maratona de Copenhaga 2027?<\/summary><div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">A Maratona de Copenhaga 2027 realiza-se no domingo, 9 de maio de 2027, com partida oficial \u00e0s 09:30 (CET) por vagas (start groups). A \u00e1rea de partida e Runners Area abre \u00e0s 07:30 e o encerramento oficial da meta ocorre \u00e0s 16:00.<\/div><\/details><details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\"><summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Qual \u00e9 o pre\u00e7o de inscri\u00e7\u00e3o e como funcionam as vagas para 2027?<\/summary><div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">O valor oficial da inscri\u00e7\u00e3o \u00e9 de 995 DKK acrescido de 20 DKK de taxa administrativa (total de 1 015 DKK, cerca de 136,00 \u20ac), com seguro opcional de cancelamento MySafety por 99 DKK (~13,25 \u20ac). Ap\u00f3s o sorteio geral (lotaria que reuniu 80 937 candidatos para 35 000 lugares), os atletas internacionais podem ainda garantir dorsal atrav\u00e9s dos Operadores Tur\u00edsticos Oficiais (Tour Operators) ou dos Parceiros Solid\u00e1rios (Run for Charity) no site oficial.<\/div><\/details><details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\"><summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Onde e quando \u00e9 feito o levantamento do dorsal e kit de atleta?<\/summary><div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">O levantamento do dorsal personalizado, do saco oficial (Race Bag) e da t-shirt t\u00e9cnica Nike realiza-se presencialmente na Copenhagen Marathon Expo, instalada no Forum K\u00f8benhavn (Julius Thomsens Plads 1, 1925 Frederiksberg, junto \u00e0 esta\u00e7\u00e3o de Metro Forum das linhas M1 e M2), entre quarta-feira e s\u00e1bado na semana da prova, mediante apresenta\u00e7\u00e3o do Start Card digital e documento de identifica\u00e7\u00e3o com fotografia.<\/div><\/details><details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\"><summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Qual \u00e9 o tempo limite (cut-off) e a idade m\u00ednima de participa\u00e7\u00e3o?<\/summary><div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">De acordo com o regulamento oficial da Sparta Atletik & L\u00f8b, o tempo limite l\u00edquido para concluir os 42,195 km \u00e9 de 6h00 a contar do momento em que o atleta cruza a linha de partida. A idade m\u00ednima obrigat\u00f3ria no dia da maratona \u00e9 de 16 anos completos (participantes menores de 18 anos necessitam de consentimento parental).<\/div><\/details><details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\"><summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Como est\u00e3o organizados os abastecimentos ao longo do percurso?<\/summary><div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">O percurso conta com 10 zonas de abastecimento principal (aos 3,8 km, 8,1 km, 12,3 km, 16 km, 19,8 km, 24,3 km, 27,8 km, 32,7 km, 35,7 km e 38,3 km) equipadas com \u00e1gua, bebida energ\u00e9tica High5 Citrus, bananas e g\u00e9is High5 Aqua (aos 16 km e 27,8 km), al\u00e9m de duas Power Zones especiais aos 21,1 km e 35,3 km.<\/div><\/details><\/div><script type=\"application\/ld+json\" data-no-optimize=\"1\">{\"@context\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\", \"@type\": \"SportsEvent\", \"name\": \"Maratona de Copenhaga 2027\", \"startDate\": \"2027-05-09\", \"endDate\": \"2027-05-09\", \"eventAttendanceMode\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/OfflineEventAttendanceMode\", \"eventStatus\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/EventScheduled\", \"location\": {\"@type\": \"Place\", \"name\": \"Copenhaga, Dinamarca\", \"address\": {\"@type\": \"PostalAddress\", \"addressLocality\": \"Dinamarca\", \"addressRegion\": \"Dinamarca\", \"addressCountry\": \"DK\"}}, \"description\": \"A Maratona de Copenhaga 2027 realiza-se a 9 de maio na capital da Dinamarca. Corre os 42,195 km num percurso r\u00e1pido e plano pela cidade e garante o teu dorsal!\", \"image\": [\"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/09\/maratona-de-copenhaga-2027.webp\"], \"offers\": {\"@type\": \"Offer\", \"name\": \"Maratona de Copenhaga 42,195 km\", \"price\": \"136.00\", \"priceCurrency\": \"EUR\", \"availability\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/InStock\", \"url\": \"https:\/\/copenhagenmarathon.dk\/en\/\"}}<\/script><script type=\"application\/ld+json\" data-no-optimize=\"1\">{\"@context\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\", \"@type\": \"FAQPage\", \"mainEntity\": [{\"@type\": \"Question\", \"nam